{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818530/extras/16fe1b7a1965c1c19161169bd7344b78.avif?t=1760037615\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818530/extras_big/16fe1b7a1965c1c19161169bd7344b78.avif?t=1760037615 width=800 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In XasturSpa, you play as a small business owner running your very own spa.<br>Provide relaxing massages, refreshing showers, and luxurious pedicure treatments to your beautiful female customers. They love your services so much, they enjoy them fully nude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your reputation, expand your spa, and open new franchise locations to build a true wellness empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shower</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use high-quality body care products for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can serve 1\u20133 customers at the same time in the shower area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818530/extras/244ab0d978c26ea3e88aa427368bfd01.avif?t=1760037615\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818530/extras_big/244ab0d978c26ea3e88aa427368bfd01.avif?t=1760037615 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give relaxing massages\u2014your customers will react with cute, happy sounds when they enjoy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i